        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    high_prices = [150, 152, 153]\n    low_prices = [145, 148, 149]\n    closing_prices = [148, 150, 151]\n    volumes = [2000, 3500, 5000]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    typical_prices = [\n        (high + low + close) / 3\n        for high, low, close in zip(high_prices, low_prices, closing_prices)\n    ]\n\n    total_value = sum(\n        typical_price * volume\n        for typical_price, volume in zip(typical_prices, volumes)\n    )\n    total_volume = sum(volumes)\n    vwap = total_value / total_volume\n    answer = round(vwap, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
